<StudioLayout title="Work with the studio \u2014 Strategic Sloth" description="Partner with Strategic Sloth on game UI, UX, design systems, and product direction.">
<section class="page-intro container"><p class="eyebrow">LET’S WORK TOGETHER</p><h1>Good ideas deserve<br>thoughtful execution.</h1><p class="lede">Work directly with Remi Couture on game interfaces, creative tools, and the systems that bring a product together.</p></section><section class="section container compact"><div class="three-grid"><article class="plain-card"><span class="card-number">01</span><h3>Game UI & UX</h3><p>A focused interface pass or a complete system: menus, HUDs, interaction flows, and component states.</p></article><article class="plain-card"><span class="card-number">02</span><h3>Design to engine</h3><p>Clear specifications, organized assets, and practical handoffs for Unity, Unreal, Godot, and custom engines.</p></article><article class="plain-card"><span class="card-number">03</span><h3>Ongoing collaboration</h3><p>Product direction and design support as your project evolves from concept through production.</p></article></div><section class="engagement-process"><p class="eyebrow">HOW WE WORK TOGETHER</p><h2>A clear path from the start.</h2><ol><li><strong>Define the brief</strong><p>Share your project, its current stage, and where you need help.</p></li><li><strong>Agree on the scope</strong><p>Align on priorities, deliverables, timing, and budget before work begins.</p></li><li><strong>Design, review, refine</strong><p>Work through the details together, with a practical handoff to your team.</p></li></ol></section><div class="contact-panel"><div><p class="eyebrow">START A CONVERSATION</p><h2>Tell us what you’re building.</h2><p>Share a short project overview, the kind of help you need, and your timeline. We’ll take it from there.</p></div><a class="button" href="mailto:privacy@strategicsloth.com?subject=Project%20enquiry">Send a project enquiry <span>↗</span></a><p class="contact-address">privacy@strategicsloth.com</p></div><section class="project-faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title"><p class="eyebrow">BEFORE WE TALK</p><h2 id="faq-title">A few useful details.</h2><details><summary>Who will I work with?</summary><p>You’ll work directly with Remi Couture, the founder and designer behind Strategic Sloth and SliceForge.</p></details><details><summary>Can we start with a focused piece of work?</summary><p>Yes. A UI review, a menu flow, or a component system can be a useful starting point. We’ll agree on a scope that fits the problem.</p></details><details><summary>What should I include in my enquiry?</summary><p>A short project overview, your engine or platform, the help you need, and your target timing. A budget range also helps shape a realistic scope.</p></details></section></section>
